<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - some Indiana Housing maturities.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - some Indiana Housing maturities.</headline>
<text>
<p>RE: $41,185,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES D-1 (NON-AMT) AND D-2 (AMT)</p>
<p>Effective at 10:15 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, September 20, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>from the following maturities:</p>
<p>		     07/01/2015 A  07/01/2021 B  07/01/2025 B</p>
<p>		     07/01/2028 B</p>
<p>They will be free to trade.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>NatCity Capital Market</p>
<p>Samuel A. Ramirez &amp; Company, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
